dout2_009_s0","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Lab Report: Image classification experiments","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s1","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"In this report we compare several models on standard benchmarks.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s2","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s3","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"We trained each model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 64.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s4","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s5","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, at epoch 34, GRU is 4.3 points better than CNN.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s6","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, at epoch 14, GRU achieves 83.9% test accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s7","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s8","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, at epoch 8, CNN achieves 46.0% F1 score.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s9","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"LSTM attains a F1 score of 74.9% at epoch 24 (Figure 2).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s10","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"At epoch 18, CNN achieves 74.7% F1 score.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s11","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s12","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"DistilBERT achieves 63.0% test accuracy on MNIST (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s13","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"As shown in Figure 3, Ours reaches 62.2% test accuracy on MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s14","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"BERT-base outperforms Transformer by 59.8 percentage points on MNIST (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s15","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Figure 4 shows the f1 score during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s16","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"As shown in Figure 4, MobileNet outperforms Ours by 14.6 percentage points at epoch 3.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s17","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Ours attains a F1 score of over 65% at epoch 6 (Figure 4).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s18","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"On STL-10, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 89.5%.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"},{"sentence_id":"holdout2_009_s19","report_id":"holdout2_009","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":2,"nearest_figure_id":"fig4"}]}